{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_st02","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_st02","title":"万物有灵","storyCode":"IW-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"a49344eb4e94c31208c15329b0d4dde541c14d949823bfe15e4b1d9f541f9b25","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"纯2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是别麻烦我们梁大人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我倒好奇了，这梁府莫非是想来就来想走就走的地儿？梁洵再怎么不摆官架子，这也太疏忽了些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）啧，这家伙可不在说好的名单上......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，你跑不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁派来的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对，你根本不是大炎人！你来自哪儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你睡死过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这些野兽，长吻眠兽？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人分明在你的屋外盘算什么，她能是什么善茬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）既然都被发现了，干脆一不做二不休......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这位雷姆必拓来的小姐可别这么着急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是尚蜀知府的地盘，我倒是无所谓，只怕真把官差惹来，你不好对付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）......你听得懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"略懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知姑娘尊姓大名？如此冒昧来访，又是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的女性","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会说大炎话干嘛不搭理人！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓人，却有个大炎名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不关键。虽然我很少遇到这种情况，不过在这座城市里，我也不太想自找麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次没有陷阱和预谋的狩猎，实在是太容易失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死心吧，有本小姐在，你有什么阴谋诡计，那都是不成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杜小姐倒是性情中人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来你们是一伙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过正好，你们把注意力放在我身上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿灯，钻头！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不远处的兽鸣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有其他眠兽！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！它嘴里叼着的是那只酒盏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后会无期！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我站住！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你还愣着做什么，快追啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......长吻眠兽可不会在大炎栖息，更别提驯服那么多只眠兽一同作案了。这家伙多半是从其他地方一路追来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什么？要不是本小姐帮忙，你刚才可是差点被她布陷阱杀了欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看她倒没有要取我性命的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......酒盏丢了，你似乎一点不上心，就不怕梁大人怪罪下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒盏丢了，你期望的事儿不就成了，岂不是正好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......话是这么说，可事情要是脱离了我们的掌控，闹得更大怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想让郑老头吃瘪，可没打算让镖局整个完蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人，这......所说之事......太过匪夷所思，让我缓缓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怨你。就算是和年认识了这么久，我也要花点时间接受一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且恩人毫无保留地告诉我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是罗德岛的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人说的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......无论我们答不答应，有一个大国的高层机构密切关注起了罗德岛......都不是一件让人轻松的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台，礼部，听着都太吓人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我听着他们又不像是有恶意的样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许是我们把“年的家务事”想得太简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，按理说至少要让阿米娅和博士都知道之后再决定的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是可露希尔和阿米娅不应该不知道这些事情......可是她们还是答应了年当时的请求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道小炎熔有没有和办事处打过招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，那眼下风起云涌，我们该明哲保身一些，还是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们先与鲤先生商议此事，年姑且不论，夕小姐不是一个会故弄玄虚的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果夕小姐那天说的话不假，那看来这件事确实没这么简单......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此举稳妥，不愧是恩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是都已经被大炎司岁台找到头上来了，也没什么稳妥可言就是啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人？怎么突然眼都直啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个东西是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！乌有，躲开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么东西......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，这是个......金属生物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不对，茶壶，挂画......这些东西都是活的——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些东西是从哪儿冒出来——等、等等，茶壶长出脚了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打中了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哀鸣）——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像奏效了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——慢着，这东西，怎么变回普通的镇纸了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟糕——这附近到处都是——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——恩人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？什么事这么吵......呃，欸，这个花瓶为什么动起来了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊——怎么回事！这些东西是什么！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些玩意是从哪儿......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔！踩着什么了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是——是从恩人口袋里掉出来的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......乌有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么突然都冲着我来了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一只！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好险！多谢恩人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这是怎么回事？难道又有贼人打算暗算我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我倒觉得，这些东西我似乎在哪里见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，对了！和夕小姐的墨魉简直是异曲同工之妙啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，还有余孽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们是冲着年给小炎熔的护身符来的，那还用问吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——真的和墨魉是差不多的东西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盏被盗走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我疏忽了，似乎是被驯兽师操纵的野兽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒地长吻眠兽体内有特殊器官，能够分泌出某种催眠物质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但尚蜀是肯定没有这种生物的。一个身手矫健，又操纵着能引人睡眠的生物的人，确实是个盗盏的好帮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且和客栈那边，不是一伙人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你连这都知道了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你压根就不惊讶嘛。你早猜到我能猜到，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你现在的表情，这下是真的出乎你的预料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心里有数不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......藏酒盏的地方，我没告诉过任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该和别人说，酒盏在我身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我确实这么说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你看这书房，整整齐齐，唯独少了你拿来藏酒盏的那只盒子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么有谁能进梁大人的书房，又有谁能在那么短的时间里派人来摸走那只盏呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——别，别和我说太多，我还怕被卷进你们官场上的纷纷扰扰里呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮忙把那家伙背后的人揪出来不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是先把酒盏夺回来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且找那个人的事......动作要快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，小丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本小姐有名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你总这么慢慢吞吞的......梁大人对你说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些麻烦事儿，不过这次铁定和你那老爹没关系了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来咱们杜遥夜小姐还是念着父亲好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上说是年轻一辈对老前辈们有意见，你自己不愿意接这个差事，其实还有别的想法吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现、现在别说我的事情！既然你明白，就赶紧想想怎么把人追回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫夜半的身手不凡，是这么容易能抓到的么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧就巧在，身手越好，越容易上钩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过重点是，她一个雷姆必拓人，是怎么追到尚蜀来的。她的背后，又是谁在指使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是从龙门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从龙门来尚蜀，走得不急不缓，真要有心追踪我，随便挑个信使驿站就能得手，何必等我到了梁府再动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，一个雷姆必拓人，没轻没重地袭击一地知府，要么她是个傻子，要么她遭人利用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，这二者不都是在说她是个傻子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必，人在有些时候是会装傻的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有求于人的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是不是在指桑骂槐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就凭你留在房间里的那封提前写好的信，罗德岛真能有什么动作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠默契就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和他们很熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好人之间总是很熟的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"房门开着......但是鲤先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，这儿有两封信。好像有一封是给咱们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人哪，其实之前我就好奇，这位鲤兄台，究竟是什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是个侦探，挺久之前就和罗德岛有来往......主要是他家侦探事务所的雇员和罗德岛有来往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过一来二去，就认识了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，侦探啊......难怪如此心思缜密。看他那打扮装束，我还以为是位源石技艺小有所成的天师之流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那鲤兄写了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"写着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“盏被取走，渡口找慎师傅”，还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是真没把咱们当外人啊。慎师傅，是说那个其实也有些可疑的船夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不把事情好好解决，罗德岛也别想置身事外。现在还是听鲤先生的比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鲤先生是料到这件事会愈发复杂，所以一开始，才不愿意把我们卷进来吗......难道说他一早就考虑到了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么从刚才开始就一言不发？这才走了没几步路吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说你留了封信，你怎么知道他们一定会听你所言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些话和杜小姐这样的年轻人说，就显得有些自找没趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总喜欢故作老成......所以我讨厌你们这些江湖神棍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这就误会了，我怎么说也是个有执照的侦探事务所老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侦探事务所的老板就一定是侦探了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你费这么大劲，难道就真的只是为了找出这个酒盏的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不止，我也有我想要的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那个叫夜半的女贼，真就如你所说，不会真的离开尚蜀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个对梁知府的书房布置都知根知底的贼，一定会留在这里，去找她背后的主使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一她真就跑了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个雷姆必拓人要是能偷了知府的物件还安然离开，那一定是有人想让她离开——反过来说，她就一定走不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实也没有这么确定，只是赌一把而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是已经迟了吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真被她跑了，有杜小姐这般帮手，大不了追回来就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得轻松！我哪知道她从哪条道走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可既然对方是有备而来，哪有这么容易从偌大个尚蜀把人揪出来？靠杜小姐的一双腿一双眼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那靠什......等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要那破酒盏的人又不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好有人抢了，我们就看看，到底几位钓客坐江边，又是几条大鳞会上钩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经猜到是谁了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要做的，无非是请各位入座罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人一大清早喊我来，真是少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上园里的山茶花开了，你看见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是你种下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，也多亏你上心照料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人对自家院子真是半点不在意，变成我拿来打发时间的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那下次便点缀些红梅吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......随你的意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人为何如此坐立不安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有事情想要请教宁小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你倒是说呀，你梁洵什么时候也成了有话不直说的人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是关于我那朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人不相信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人从来都是相信宁小姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当真？若是如此，为什么还要特地问我一句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，千真万确......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说我不反感来见你的这几步路，可难道你找我过来，真就只是打算质问我几句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让宁小姐不快了，梁某人道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你这么紧张做什么，我有那么吓人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天一早，我先去老赵的珠宝行里，把你送我的镯子保养了一番。晌午，去文姑娘的店里挑了挑家具，我早就想换一张大些的餐桌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后与文姑娘一起，去码头见了她的丈夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午我们一起去胡大厨那儿吃了顿便饭，聊了些家常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最后我去白叔叔那儿，看着他教那些陶工学徒，陪他散了散步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人还有什么想问的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我送你的镯子只是寻常的银镯子，不值钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不值钱就不许我喜欢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说白叔前些日子受了风寒，他年纪其实也不小了，到了该注意身体的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是白叔叔在尚蜀做了十年陶工，每日下午三个时辰，雷打不动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"习惯成自然，已经劝不动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天一日，你把他们五人都见了一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例行公事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，质问完我的梁洵梁大人，下一步是不是就要摔门而去了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天快亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个点，去戏园早了些吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实不适合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道我身体不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去泡壶热茶，你等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，宁小姐昨日从我书房拿走的那本书......看完了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但雪还没化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有个问题要问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看得见......这些越来越多的小玩意么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这些东西是因那酒盏而起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就说明这条路我们赌对了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......怎么没追过来？这也太容易了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我看看信件......那说书的好像改行了？陶工？陶工是什么......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要去何处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——谁！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那“下落不明”的酒盏，为何在你怀里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......嘎......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
